Package: dwarfs-tools
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: tools for inspecting and extracting DwarFS images
 DwarFS is a high-compression, read-only filesystem. This package provides
 the tools to inspect, verify, and extract DwarFS filesystem images.
